<title>USA: Washington Federal Savings raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Washington Federal Savings raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Federal Inc said it raised its dividend to $0.22 per share, payable May 2 to shareholders of record April 9.</p>
<p>It said the old dividend, after adjusting for the 11-for-10 stock split paid in February, was $0.218 per share.</p>
</text>
